      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Thurlow Dam, Alabama Power’s hydroelectric plant completed in 1930, supplies much of Tallassee’s electricity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
